  "details": "Some avatar prefabs are starting to take advantage of avatars having the generated finger contacts; however it might not fit for some avatars to have the auto-generated colliders (like avatars that wouldn't have fingers).  \nUnfortunately there isn't a way to disable the collision for a specific generated collider and keep the contact so these prefabs will stop working.  \nThe only workaround for this would be to manually add finger contact senders for each finger, but this ends up adding to the performance rating while the auto-generated ones wouldn't have added to it.",
